{"id":"e9902e08d91c5bd3","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-prob4-predictable-process.md","title":"ZFC Prob4 Predictable Process","display":"df-zfc-prob4-predictable-process — ZFC Prob4 Predictable Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob4-predictable-process","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob4-predictable-process"],"display":"df-zfc-prob4-predictable-process — ZFC Prob4 Predictable Process","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob4-predictable-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob4-predictable-process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob4-predictable-process — ZFC Prob4 Predictable Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\vec X,n,m,B\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\vec X,n,m,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4PredictableProcess}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4PredictableProcess}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}predictable\\text{-}process} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4PredictableProcess}_S(\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\vec X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n),\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in m\\to\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n)\\subseteq\\vec{\\mathcal F}(m))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\Omega\\times\\mathbb R))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X(n),\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(\\vec X(0);\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F}(0))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(\\vec X(n+1);\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}predictable\\text{-}process} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4PredictableProcess}_S(\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\vec X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n),\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in m\\to\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n)\\subseteq\\vec{\\mathcal F}(m))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\Omega\\times\\mathbb R))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X(n),\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(\\vec X(0);\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F}(0))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(\\vec X(n+1);\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In discrete time, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0\">\\(X_0\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_0\">\\(\\mathcal F_0\\)</span>-measurable and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{n+1}\">\\(X_{n+1}\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_n\">\\(\\mathcal F_n\\)</span>-measurable.</li>\n<li>The filtration now consists of sigma-algebras on one common sample space and is increasing.</li>\n<li>Each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_n\">\\(X_n\\)</span> is explicitly a function from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>; it is not\nconfused with a scalar value.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\vec X,n,m,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4PredictableProcess}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}predictable\\text{-}process} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4PredictableProcess}_S(\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\vec X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n),\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;(n\\in m\\to\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n)\\subseteq\\vec{\\mathcal F}(m))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\Omega\\times\\mathbb R))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X(n),\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(\\vec X(0);\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F}(0))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(\\vec X(n+1);\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n))","display":true},{"tex":"X_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_0","display":false},{"tex":"X_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_n","display":false},{"tex":"X_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false}],"bytes":1953,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3200","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-prob4-predictable-process.md|58-df-zfc-prob4-predictable-process]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a740bdad87b97ac6","36d7463d215be751","bbbec05fde1d3b01"]}